hen some or all of the money that you invested in the Fund is paid back to you. A return of capital distribution does not necessarily reflect the Fund’s investment performance and should not be confused with ‘yield’ or ‘income’."]},{"type":"p","children":["The amounts and sources of distributions reported in this notice are only estimates and are not being provided for tax reporting purposes. The actual amounts and sources of the amounts for tax reporting purposes will depend upon the Fund’s investment experience during the remainder of the fiscal year and may be subject to changes based on tax regulations. The Fund or your broker will send you a Form 1099-DIV for the calendar year that will tell you how to report these distributions for federal income tax purposes."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["About the Fund\n"]},"DNP Select Income Fund Inc. is a closed-end diversified investment management company whose primary investment objectives are current income and long-term growth of income. The Fund seeks to achieve these objectives by investing primarily in a diversified portfolio of equity and fixed income securities of companies in the public utilities industry. For more information, contact shareholder services at (877) 381-2537, by email at ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:duff@virtus.com","linkText":"duff@virtus.com"}},", or visit the DNP website, ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink\u0026url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dpimc.com%2Finvestment-strategies%2Fdnp-select-income-fund-inc\u0026esheet=54601068\u0026newsitemid=20260909129590\u0026lan=en-US\u0026anchor=dpimc.com%2Fdnp\u0026index=2\u0026md5=b10dd9d636e18d593f3df101b09e2a61","linkText":"dpimc.com/dnp"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["About the Investment Adviser\n"]},"Duff \u0026 Phelps Investment Management Co. is a boutique investment manager that specializes in listed real asset strategies for institutional and individual clients. An investment manager of Virtus Investment Partners, Inc. (NYSE: VRTS), the firm began in 1932 as a fundamental research firm and has been managing assets since 1979. The firm seeks to provide specialty investment strategies that enhance client outcomes through active portfolio management and customized solutions, utilizing a process with values that include quality, reliability, and specialization. Investment strategies include U.S. and global real estate securities, global listed infrastructure, energy infrastructure, water, and clean energy. For more information visit dpimc.com."]},{"type":"p","children":["View source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260909129590/en/"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"BusinessWire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"business_wire"}]},{"title":"ETFs","args":[{"id":"category","value":"etf"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"copyright":"2026 Business Wire, Inc., All rights reserved.","id":"business_wire:4ca3ae84c75e4:0","title":"DNP Select Income Fund Inc. Discloses Sources of Distribution – Section 19(a) Notice","published":1788984600,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"NYSE:DNP","logoid":"dnp-select-income-fund","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"dnp-select-income-fund"}}],"storyPath":"/news/business_wire:4ca3ae84c75e4:0-dnp-select-income-fund-inc-discloses-sources-of-distribution-section-19-a-notice/","read_time":168,"provider":{"id":"business_wire","name":"BusinessWire","logo_id":"business-wire"}}